  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/08/P1130989.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">(70 fotos) El centro hist&oacute;rico y el castillo de Onda son un hervidero a la hora de la comida de este viernes ultimando los detalles para la Feria Medieval, que abrir&aacute; sus puertas a las 18 horas y estar&aacute; abierta hasta bien entrada la noche del domingo, desde la Font de Dins, donde La Cantina Colonial y La Toska ofrecen men&uacute;s especiales, a lo alto de la fortaleza, que tiene su propia Taberna del Druida.</span></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/08/Programa-Feria-Medieval-15-Onda-1.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 341px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">El programa completo por horas para los tres d&iacute;as es el siguiente:</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); line-height: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><u>Viernes 7</u></span></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); line-height: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><strong style=\"font-size: 14px;\">FERIA MEDIEVAL</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); line-height: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">A las 18.30 h</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); line-height: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">En el Casco Antiguo</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); line-height: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Apertura del mercado con batucada y personajes medievales</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); line-height: 16pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); line-height: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">A las 18.30 h</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); line-height: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">En el Casco Antiguo</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); line-height: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Taller Infantil</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); line-height: 16pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); line-height: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">A las 20.00 h</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); line-height: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">En la Plaza del Almud&iacute;n</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); line-height: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Preg&oacute;n de los caballeros templarios y de la comparsa mora</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); line-height: 16pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); line-height: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">A las 21.00 h</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); line-height: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">En el Castillo</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); line-height: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Lucha entre caballeros y demostraci&oacute;n de cetrer&iacute;a</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); line-height: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">A las 22.00 h</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); line-height: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">En el Casco Antiguo</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); line-height: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Cierre con fuego y bailarinas a ritmo de batucada</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); line-height: 16pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); line-height: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">A las 23.00 h</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); line-height: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">En el Castillo</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); line-height: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Espect&aacute;culo de caballos con antorchas</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); line-height: 16pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); line-height: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><u>S&aacute;bado 8</u></span></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); line-height: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><strong style=\"font-size: 14px;\">FERIA MEDIEVAL</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); line-height: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">De 11.00 h a 13.00 h y de 18.00 h a 20.00 h</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); line-height: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">En el Castillo</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); line-height: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Exhibici&oacute;n de tiro con arco y participaci&oacute;n del p&uacute;blico asistente</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); line-height: 16pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); line-height: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">A las 12.30 h</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); line-height: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">En la Iglesia Mayor</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); line-height: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Concierto de campanas</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); line-height: 16pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); line-height: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">A las 18.30 h</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); line-height: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">En el Casco Antiguo</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); line-height: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Taller Infantil</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); line-height: 16pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); line-height: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">A las 19.00 h</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); line-height: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">En el Casco Antiguo</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); line-height: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Desfile de los caballeros templarios y de la comparsa mora</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); line-height: 16pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); line-height: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">A las 20.30 h</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); line-height: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">En el Castillo</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); line-height: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Torneo medieval a caballo</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); line-height: 16pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); line-height: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">A las 22.00 h</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); line-height: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">En el Castillo</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); line-height: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Concierto de m&uacute;sica celta con Tempus Fugit</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); line-height: 16pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); line-height: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">A las 22.00 h</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); line-height: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">En el Casco Antiguo</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); line-height: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Cierre con fuego y bailarinas a ritmo de batucada</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); line-height: 16pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); line-height: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><u>Domingo 9</u></span></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); line-height: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><strong style=\"font-size: 14px;\">FERIA MEDIEVAL</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); line-height: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">De 11.00 h a 13.00 h</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); line-height: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">En el Castillo</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); line-height: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Exhibici&oacute;n de tiro con arco y participaci&oacute;n del p&uacute;blico asistente</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); line-height: 16pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); line-height: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">A las 18.30 h</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); line-height: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">En el Casco Antiguo</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); line-height: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Taller Infantil</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); line-height: 16pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); line-height: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">A las 20.30 h</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); line-height: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">En el Castillo</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); line-height: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Torneo medieval a caballo</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); line-height: 16pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); line-height: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">A las 21.30 h</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); line-height: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">En el Castillo</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); line-height: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Actuaci&oacute;n del gran Fakir Kirman</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: Aria